Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Equilibria extravaganza - let the diffusion begin", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9857574824402933`*^9, 
  3.985757533369891*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eec08489-9a08-4601-b0e7-\
34cfdf9d6d41"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1 D Sanity check", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9857574511160307`*^9, 
  3.985757473494307*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e9fd1078-196a-4b0d-9254-\
47860f19c15a"],

Cell["\<\
In this section i am looking at the Kimura famous 1 D diffusion, i calculate \
back V - which is the potential energy and then i will plug this in the \
Boltzmann distribution for the equilibria to verify\[LineSeparator]we indeed \
see the Wright equilibria-- which should coincide\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.985757573609003*^9, 3.985757605370865*^9}, {
   3.985757648749423*^9, 3.9857576768361197`*^9}, 3.985758033692717*^9, {
   3.9857637026887712`*^9, 
   3.9857637047697687`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a0f1f436-01b1-49bc-a6cb-\
09651dfd7f99"],

