Cell["\<\
OK now we are trying to get again MIso\[CloseCurlyQuote]s figure 5A, we \
rewrite the equilibrium as a function of both N and S.\[LineSeparator]and see \
whats the final information at equilibria is and also we see whats the free \
fitness as a function of both N and S.\[LineSeparator]BOth these cases now \
are for Haploids.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.985765019717092*^9, {3.985765094637945*^9, 
   3.9857651768057833`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b592b12b-3589-45d0-bd80-\
